# Customer Churn & Retention Analysis

## Business Problem
This project analyzes customer churn behavior to identify patterns affecting retention, revenue loss, and customer engagement.

## Objectives
- Analyze churn trends
- Identify high-risk customer segments
- Evaluate revenue impact
- Generate actionable retention insights

## Tools Used
- SQL
- Python
- Power BI
- Figma
- Excel

## Dataset Overview
The dataset contains customer subscription, engagement, support activity, and revenue information.

## Key KPIs
- Churn Rate
- Retention Rate
- Revenue Lost
- Customer Lifetime Value

## Key Insights
- Monthly contracts showed the highest churn rate.
- Enterprise churn generated significant revenue loss.
- Basic customers presented the highest abandonment rate.
- Low engagement correlated strongly with churn behavior.

